Why the AGPL
------------

TinyPPI serves a web dashboard over the network (resources/lib/web/).  Under
the plain GPL, someone could run a modified TinyPPI as a network service
without ever publishing their changes.  Section 13 of the AGPL closes that
gap: if you modify TinyPPI and let anyone interact with it over a network,
you must offer those users the source of your modified version.


