  script.module.sidedata  -- GPL-2.0-or-later, by matthane
                             https://github.com/matthane/script.module.sidedata
                             Declared as an add-on dependency in addon.xml.
                             Parses the Dolby Vision RPU, the dvcC/dvvC
                             configuration record, the HDR10+ ST 2094-40
                             metadata and the static MDCV / CLL SEIs.

  dovi_tool / libdovi     -- by quietvoid
                             https://github.com/quietvoid/dovi_tool
